    "preamble": "Monu Quraisi vs State Of Up And 4 Others on 24 April, 2025 Author: Ashwani Kumar Mishra Bench: Ashwani Kumar Mishra High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:63264-Db Court No. - 29 Case :- Writ - C No. - 12450 of 2025 Petitioner :- Monu Quraisi Respondent :- State Of Up And 4 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Pradeep Kumar Sharma Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Vineet Sankalp Hon'ble Ashwani Kumar Mishra,J. Hon'ble Praveen Kumar Giri,J. 1.",
    "facts": "2. This petition has been filed challenging the notice dated 24.01.2025, issued by the Nagar Nigam, Varanasi, whereby petitioner has been called upon to stop running of unauthorized shop as it is creating nuisance for the residents of the locality. 3. On behalf of respondents, it is urged that provisions of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 have been violated. 4. Admittedly, petitioner had licence to run the shop till 2016, which is not renewed. As of now, petitioner has no right to run the shop itself.",
